le pathways, including the AU-rich element (ARE)-mediated pathway, microRNA-mediated pathway and the nonsense-mediated pathway (NMD) (PubMed:28559491). Its activity is required for efficient P-body formation (PubMed:28559491). May be involved in regulating mRNAs of genes involved in cell cycle progression and cell proliferation (PubMed:28559491)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with PAN2 (PubMed:28559491). Interacts (via N-terminus) with PABPC1 at higher efficiency than isoform 1 (PubMed:28559491)"}],"length":833,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,230],[231,285,603]],"edits":[{"start":231,"end":284,"original":"PRKYRLGMLEERLVPMGSKARKAKNPIGCLADRCKSGVPI","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":54,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[1,54,0],[2,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q58A45-3-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q58A45-3-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":64.7,"plddt":[[0,43],[50,3],[70,23],[50,4],[0,37],[50,1],[0,228],[50,7],[0,1],[70,1],[50,3],[0,9],[50,9],[0,2],[50,8],[0,1],[50,7],[70,30],[90,14],[70,4],[50,9],[70,5],[90,25],[70,2],[90,1],[70,1],[90,41],[70,1],[90,8],[70,3],[50,6],[70,1],[50,3],[0,10],[50,4],[70,2],[90,38],[70,2],[90,15],[70,4],[50,3],[70,4],[90,24],[70,8],[90,25],[70,5],[90,6],[70,3],[90,1],[70,1],[90,8],[70,2],[90,2],[70,2],[90,1],[70,5],[90,2],[70,1],[90,17],[70,17],[90,16],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,4],[70,3],[90,21],[70,4],[90,23],[70,2],[90,1],[70,1],[50,2]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"Q58A45-4","name":"4","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":687,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,683]],"edits":[{"start":684,"end":887,"original":"QADLISLGKVVLALACNSLAGIQRENLQKAMELVTINYSS","replacement":"VSKN","added":4}],"missing":204,"replaced":0,"novel":4,"foldedAbsent":198,"foldedMissing":198,"features":[[5,67,0],